    "Flex your phone to see the reveal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "折叠手机查看展开效果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slide to preview the reveal effect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "滑动预览展开效果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create or customize wallpapers with our editor": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用编辑器创建或自定义壁纸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save your creation to your photo library": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将作品保存到照片图库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use our free shortcut to set your wallpaper": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用免费快捷指令设置壁纸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Note: iOS doesn't allow apps to set wallpapers directly. DuoWall creates the perfect image, and you apply it with a simple tap.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注意：iOS 不允许应用直接设置壁纸。DuoWall 创建完美图像，你只需轻点即可应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The DuoWall Apply shortcut lets you set your wallpaper with one tap after exporting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DuoWall 应用快捷指令让你在导出后一键设置壁纸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Safe Areas by Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认显示安全区域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shortcut": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快捷指令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get DuoWall Apply Shortcut": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "获取 DuoWall 应用快捷指令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Re-run Onboarding": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新运行引导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purchase": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "购买"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore Purchases": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复购买"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why can't DuoWall set my wallpaper directly?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为什么 DuoWall 不能直接设置壁纸？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS doesn't provide an API for apps to set wallpapers. DuoWall creates the perfect image, and you apply it using the Shortcuts app or Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 不提供应用设置壁纸的 API。DuoWall 创建完美图像，你可以使用快捷指令或设置来应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How does the reveal effect work?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "展开效果是如何工作的？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone Duo uses one wallpaper image for both displays. The outer screen shows a cropped center portion. DuoWall helps you design images that look great on both screens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone Duo 两块屏幕使用同一张壁纸。外屏显示裁剪的中心部分。DuoWall 帮助你设计在两个屏幕上都好看的图像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What size should my wallpaper be?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸应该是什么尺寸？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DuoWall exports at 2670×1878 pixels (the inner display resolution). iOS automatically crops this for the outer display.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DuoWall 以 2670×1878 像素导出（内屏分辨率）。iOS 会自动为外屏裁剪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can I use different wallpapers for each screen?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我可以为每个屏幕使用不同的壁纸吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Currently, iOS uses one wallpaper for both screens. If Apple adds per-display wallpaper support, we'll update the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前，iOS 两个屏幕使用同一张壁纸。如果 Apple 添加分屏壁纸支持，我们会更新应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's included in Pro?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro 包含什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro removes the watermark, unlocks all 30 bundled pairs, and adds text and gradient layers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro 移除水印，解锁全部 30 对壁纸，并添加文本和渐变图层。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Privacy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐私"
